# Visual-regression baselines are committed for Linux only -- that is what CI
# compares against. A macOS run writes its own -darwin set locally, which is
# useful for checking a change before pushing but must not be committed: it
# doubles the repo's image weight and nothing ever reads it.
tests/**/*-darwin.png
